{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05362","headline":"櫂歌行 · 徐坚","name":"櫂歌行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"櫂女饰银钩，新妆下翠楼。\n霜丝青桂檝，兰栧紫霞舟。\n水落金陵曙，风起洞庭秋。\n扣舷过曲浦，飞帆越回流。\n影入桃花浪，香飘杜若洲。\n洲长殊未返，萧散云霞晚。\n日下大江平，烟生归岸远。\n岸远闻潮波，争途游戏多。\n因声赵津女，来听采菱歌。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐坚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05362.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05362","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}